# Supabase — copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values from your
# Supabase dashboard (Project Settings -> API).
#
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL          the project URL, e.g. https://abcd.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY     the PUBLIC anon / publishable key
#
# Rules:
#   - the `VITE_` prefix is required: Vite only exposes variables that have it;
#   - use the public anon/publishable key — NEVER the service-role key;
#   - the service-role key must never reach React code, `.env` files that are
#     committed, or browser JavaScript;
#   - Vite reads these when the dev server starts, so restart `npm run dev`
#     after changing them (a browser refresh is not enough).
#
# `.env`, `.env.local` and `.env.*.local` are git-ignored.
